 //! requires (`VK_KHR_swapchain` with `VK_KHR_surface`; `swapchain_maintenance1` with its surface
 //! counterpart and `VK_KHR_get_surface_capabilities2`), which the runtime checks before it makes
 //! the instance (`Error::InstanceExtensionRequired`).
+//!
+//! **Instance version.** With no explicit request, the same loader is asked for its highest
+//! instance version: 1.3 is requested where it supports that version, so dynamic rendering can
+//! be enabled. Older or unavailable answers keep the runtime's 1.2 default. This negotiation
+//! also runs where the loader lists no surface support; the runtime checks an explicit request
+//! against its loader again before creating the instance.
 
